      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Glendale’s Grand Avenue, built in 1892, was the first diagonal road linking Phoenix to Peoria, boosting early commerce.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
